LNS-(w)PBS

The implementations of LNS-PBS and LNS-wPBS are based on the RHCR codebase https://github.com/Jiaoyang-Li/RHCR. 

Other parameters that are specific to this project:
- task_truncated_size: the number of tasks that we truncate in the task sequence
- look_ahead_horizon: 1 implies no look-ahead horizon applied

To reproduce the results in our paper:

* TABLE II

LNS-wPBS

./lifelong -m ../../data/Instances/small/kiva-10-500-5.map -k 10 --scenario=KIVAONLINE --planning_window=10 --solver=PBS --seed=0 --task ../../data/Instances/small/kiva-0.2.task --task_truncated_size 2

LNS-PBS

./lifelong -m ../../data/Instances/small/kiva-10-500-5.map -k 10 --scenario=KIVAONLINE --solver=PBS --seed=0 --task ../../data/Instances/small/kiva-0.2.task --task_truncated_size 2

* TABLE III

LNS-wPBS

./lifelong -m ../../data/Instances/large/kiva-100-1000-50.map -k 100 --scenario=KIVAONLINE --planning_window=10 --solver=PBS --seed=0 --task ../../data/Instances/large/kiva-1000-50.task --task_truncated_size 2

LNS-PBS

./lifelong -m ../../data/Instances/large/kiva-100-1000-50.map -k 100 --scenario=KIVAONLINE --solver=PBS --seed=0 --task ../../data/Instances/large/kiva-1000-50.task --task_truncated_size 2

* TABLE IV

./lifelong -m ../../data/Instances/large/kiva-1000.map -k 1000 --scenario=KIVAONLINE --planning_window=10 --solver=PBS --seed=0 --task ../../data/Instances/large/kiva-1000.task --task_truncated_size 2

* TABLE V

LA1: 

./lifelong -m ../../data/Instances/small/kiva-10-500-5.map -k 10 --scenario=KIVAONLINE --planning_window=10 --solver=PBS --seed=0 --task ../../data/Instances/small/kiva-2.task --look_ahead_horizon 2 --task_truncated_size 2
